This '''species''' was a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]] that existed in [[the galaxy]].<ref name="Solo" />

==Biology and appearance==
This bipedal sentient species<ref name="Solo" /> was distinguished by their ability to breathe dust,<ref name="Mando 3" /> their distinct masks, and saucer-shaped helmets.<ref name="Solo" />

==Species in the galaxy==
{{Quote|Look, I told you I'm not interested in your excuses!''"<br />[the bounty hunter speaks Huttese]<br />"''You had your shot, dust breather, but you failed. No pucks for you. Now get outta here.''"<br />[the bounty hunter speaks Huttese]"''|Greef Karga and the bounty hunter|audio=SaucerHeadExcuses-TMS01CH03.flac|<ref name="Mando 3" />}}
In [[10 BBY]],<ref name="Timeline">''[[Star Wars: Timelines]]''</ref> a [[Cynogan]]-speaking member of this species known as [[Saucer Head]] served as dealer in the [[Sabaac]] game where [[Han Solo]] won the [[Millennium Falcon]] from [[Landonis Balthazar Calrissian]] within [[The Lodge]] on the [[planet]] [[Vandor]]. By [[9 ABY]],<ref name="MandoDate1">{{MandoDate|1}}</ref> another member of this species worked as a [[bounty hunter]] within the [[Bounty Hunters' Guild]], present at the [[Nevarro school|cantina]] on the planet [[Nevarro]] where the [[Mandalorian]] [[bounty]] [[Hunting|hunter]] [[Din Djarin]] claimed a bounty from Guild agent [[Greef Karga]],<ref name="Mando 1">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 1: The Mandalorian}}</ref> who also chastised this [[Huttese]]-speaking individual for failing as assignment.<ref name="Mando 3" />

==Behind the scenes==
[[File:SaucerHead-Davies.png|thumb|right|160px|Concept art of this species by Jake Lunt Davies]]
This species first appeared in the [[2018]] film, ''[[Solo: A Star Wars Story]]'',<ref name="Solo" /> designed by concept artist [[Jake Lunt Davies]].<ref name="Artbook">''[[The Art of Solo: A Star Wars Story]]''</ref> Though this species' design bears a noticeable resemblance to another saucer hat-wearing species, the [[Kyuzo]], Davies confirmed there was no intentional connection.'<ref name="JLD Tweet">{{Twitter|JakeLuntDavies|status/1623953307847753728|[[Jake Lunt Davies]]|date=2023-02-10|quote=I hadn’t seen the 2nd pic before. And I never intended that he was Kyuzu, I just like those kind of disc hats!|archiveurl=https://ghostarchive.org/archive/eIKLj}}</ref>

